===========================================================================
Explicitly Permitted - Free, And No Need To Ask
===========================================================================

The NonCommercial term above is often read more narrowly than intended, so
the author expressly grants the following to everyone, including people
working inside commercial companies, banks, vendors, agencies and public
bodies:

  - Printing the poster and displaying it in your lab, office, SOC,
    classroom or at a conference stand
  - Sharing the files with your colleagues, your team or your students
  - Using the table in internal training, onboarding, playbooks and
    reference material
  - Using it in university teaching, courses, lectures and academic
    presentations
  - Quoting it, citing it and building further work upon it

None of the above counts as commercial use and none of it requires asking
for permission. Working for a for-profit organisation does not by itself
make your use commercial: what matters is the purpose of the use, not who
your employer is.


